WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.299
Punch in, punch out. Attendance for the
app field auditors use on site visits.

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.061
The app tracked the audit, but not the
auditor. No one could see when they

3
00:00:10.061 --> 00:00:11.765
arrived, or how long they stayed.

4
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:16.866
With three days on a live app, nothing was
rebuilt. Punch in now starts each

5
00:00:16.866 --> 00:00:18.692
visit, and punch out ends it.

6
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:23.409
Auditors punch in with a selfie, stamped
with their location and the time.

7
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.511
Time on site stays on top, and punching
out unlocks submit.

8
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:35.092
Weak GPS or a forgotten punch out gets
flagged for review. It never blocks the

9
00:00:35.092 --> 00:00:35.452
audit.

10
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.149
Every state and edge case, handed off in
three days.
